p-is-an-ugly-reality-how-to-understand-where-it-comes-from:12] Racism at the World Cup is an ugly reality. How to understand where it comes from: On the one hand, Schweinsteiger faced criticism that his statement was racist . (attribute: https://theconversation.com/racism-at-the-world-cup-is-an-ugly-reality-how-to-understand-where-it-comes-from-287297)\n  - [claim:racism-at-the-world-cup-is-an-ugly-reality-how-to-understand-where-it-comes-from:13] Racism at the World Cup is an ugly reality. How to understand where it comes from: As Cote dâ€™Ivoireâ€™s manager, Emerse Fae, said : It is odd he would speak that way. (attribute: https://theconversation.com/racism-at-the-world-cup-is-an-ugly-reality-how-to-understand-where-it-comes-from-287297)\n  - [claim:racism-at-the-world-cup-is-an-ugly-reality-how-to-understand-where-it-comes-from:14] Racism at the World Cup is an ugly reality. How to understand where it comes from: We could call it racist â€¦ I can only hope it is a clumsy statement, rather than something going on in his mind. (attribute: https://theconversation.com/racism-at-the-world-cup-is-an-ugly-reality-how-to-understand-where-it-comes-from-287297)\n  - [claim:racism-at-the-world-cup-is-an-ugly-reality-how-to-understand-where-it-comes-from:15] Racism at the World Cup is an ugly reality. How to understand where it comes from: On the other hand, there were many people on online forums and social media who wondered why Schweinsteigerâ€™s statement was considered racist, as did his broadcaster, ARD. (attribute: https://theconversation.com/racism-at-the-world-cup-is-an-ugly-reality-how-to-understand-where-it-comes-from-287297)\n  - [claim:racism-at-the-world-cup-is-an-ugly-reality-how-to-understand-where-it-comes-from:16] Racism at the World Cup is an ugly reality. How to understand where it comes from: Schweinsteiger responded weakly to the criticism: I was talking about football, not people. (attribute: https://theconversation.com/racism-at-the-world-cup-is-an-ug